==Strategy==
This stage is dominated with Red peons, so don't forget to bring some [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] to help deal with them. This is one of the harder Street Fighter stages, so be prepared. You'll need a few tanky ranged units to successfully deal with Ryu while also managing E. Honda's knockback. Dhalsim will only spawn after killing a few peons, so take advantage of it.

